<surname>Eastell</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Genant</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Grauer</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Cahall</surname><given-names>DL</given-names></name><article-title>Underdiagnosis of vertebral fractures is a worldwide problem: the IMPACT study</article-title><source>J Bone Miner Res</source><year>2005</year><volume>20</volume><fpage>557</fpage><lpage>563</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1359/JBMR.041214</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15765173</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B7"><mixed-citation publication-type="other"><article-title>Physician's guide to prevention and treatment of osteoporosis</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.geios.es/download.php?path=pdfs&#x00026;filename=GEIOS_20090422154918_guia25.pdf">http://www.geios.es/download.php?path=pdfs&#x00026;filename=GEIOS_20090422154918_guia25.pdf</ext-link></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B8"><mixed-citation publication-type="other"><article-title>Ost&#x000e9;odensitom&#x000e9;trie [absorbim&#x000e9;trie osseuse] sur 2 sites par m&#x000e9;thode biphotonique</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.has-sante.fr/portail/upload/docs/application/pdf/osteodensitometrie_rapport.pdf">http://www.has-sante.fr/portail/upload/docs/application/pdf/osteodensitometrie_rapport.pdf</ext-link></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B9"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Lespessailles</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Cotte</surname><given-names>FE</given-names></name><name><surname>Roux</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Fardellone</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Mercier</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Gaudin</surname><given-names>AF</given-names></name><article-title>Prevalence and features of osteoporosis in the French general popul